demo/

# Local-only agent tooling (skills, settings) — not shipped
.claude/

# Throwaway fixture files generated by the simulation tool
.simulations/

# Local-only planning workspace — designs in flux, not shipped.
#
# Planning docs and `docs/` are different things. A plan changes as the shape of
# the work changes and is worth nothing once the work lands; `docs/` is the
# source of truth for what the software actually does. Keeping plans out of the
# repository stops that churn reaching reviewers and stops a half-decided design
# being mistaken for documentation.
#
# The plans already under `docs/plans/` predate this and stay tracked: they are
# a record of decisions that have been made, and they are linked from the docs
# index. New planning goes here.
planning/
